# Integrasi Full KPSP Assessment Flow

Mengimplementasikan alur KPSP secara end-to-end:
1. **Load soal dari API** (GET `/assessment-kpsp-questions?month_target=...`)
2. **Submit jawaban → CREATE** (POST `/children/{child_id}/development-reports`)
3. **Ulangi Asesmen → UPDATE** (PATCH `/development-reports/{report_id}`)

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Parsing `monthTarget` dari [age](file:///f:/Project/ProjectLomba/nuzagizi/lib/features/mother/development/presentation/pages/kpsp_result_page.dart#14-592) String

**Situasi:** Endpoint `GET /children` (endpoint 11) hanya mengembalikan [age](file:///f:/Project/ProjectLomba/nuzagizi/lib/features/mother/development/presentation/pages/kpsp_result_page.dart#14-592) sebagai String terformat server (contoh: `"2 tahun 3 bulan"`). `birth_date` **tidak dikembalikan** di endpoint list ini. Tidak perlu ubah entity/model.

**Algoritma server (endpoint.md baris 744):** `month_target = periode TERBESAR yang <= age_months`. Server tetap memvalidasi `month_target` saat POST/PATCH dan return `422` jika tidak valid — sehingga ada *safety net*.

**Solusi:** Buat fungsi utility di Presentation Layer yang:
1. Parse `"X tahun Y bulan"` → total bulan
2. Snap ke KPSP period terdekat ke bawah dari `[3,6,9,12,15,18,21,24,30,36,42,48,54,60]`

#### [NEW] [kpsp_month_target_helper.dart](file:///f:/Project/ProjectLomba/nuzagizi/lib/features/mother/development/presentation/utils/kpsp_month_target_helper.dart)
```dart
const _periods = [3,6,9,12,15,18,21,24,30,36,42,48,54,60];

/// Parse "X tahun Y bulan" atau "X bulan" → snap ke KPSP period
int monthTargetFromAgeString(String age) {
  int months = 0;
  final tahun = RegExp(r'(\d+)\s*tahun').firstMatch(age);
  final bulan = RegExp(r'(\d+)\s*bulan').firstMatch(age);
  if (tahun != null) months += int.parse(tahun.group(1)!) * 12;
  if (bulan != null) months += int.parse(bulan.group(1)!);
  return _periods.lastWhere((p) => p <= months, orElse: () => _periods.first);
}
```

> **Tidak ada perubahan** pada [ChildHeaderEntity](file:///f:/Project/ProjectLomba/nuzagizi/lib/features/mother/home/domain/entities/child_header_entity.dart#3-19) atau [ChildHeaderModel](file:///f:/Project/ProjectLomba/nuzagizi/lib/features/mother/home/data/models/child_header_model.dart#3-27).

